check 1
# Area B (q-diff-combat-a1): the player's melee attack. Blood Moor (warp 2
# at frame 4; town allows no combat), seeds pinned and a fallen
# (monstats 19, normal; its party gets GUIDs 19 and up after the level's
# own monsters) poked 3 sub-tiles east at frame 30; from frame 34 the
# player's left skill (attack, skill 0) on GUID 19 every 20 frames as
# C->S 0x06 (poke `msg`, specs/tools/poke.md §1): approach, swing,
# to-hit roll, damage, hit reaction or block, the fallen's counterattack
# and flee, death and drop. Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name combat-melee-fallen
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 260
seconds 600
channels state
at 4 poke warp 2
at 30 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 30 poke seed-unit @player 0x00000055 666
at 30 poke spawn 19 @x+3 @y normal
at 34 poke msg 0x06 1 19
at 54 poke msg 0x06 1 19
at 74 poke msg 0x06 1 19
at 94 poke msg 0x06 1 19
at 114 poke msg 0x06 1 19
at 134 poke msg 0x06 1 19
at 154 poke msg 0x06 1 19
at 174 poke msg 0x06 1 19
